  "richContent": "<p>收益率 &amp; 仓位 </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>今天10/31，明天才是1号，但在周末，数据已安静，就今天更了。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>同10月，A股的一堆宽：</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>中证全指 -12.32%；</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>创业 -23%；</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>科创 -24%；</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>A50 -5.8%；</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>A500 -10.7%； </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>300 -8.5%；</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>500 -15.7%；</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>1000 -15.6%；</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>中证偏股（约）：-15.6%</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>平均股价：-18%</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>差距就是这样拉开的。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/A9038E3C-CFE0-49B0-9469-543F8C381E95.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/CC2478AC-DC10-49D6-BC4F-91AF8B1B0C75.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/8B8E4341-AB0A-4593-9BD1-3DC1B3E7D57B.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/970DE055-724C-4E6D-B3F6-AB257207E786.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/E32F6F20-6D0A-4BF4-8A75-AFC1C093F615.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/97D92B45-7D05-4473-9B3A-58D989D59FE6.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/B8A6593D-4E97-46F5-98DA-BAD8CCBC0D19.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/C7604AD0-656D-49B2-A930-2700D5F074F0.png\" />",
